ly or just starting to learn English, your journey is fully personalized.\n\n- Multilingual Support for Beginners\nJust starting out? You can learn and practice English even if your native language is Spanish, Portuguese, Turkish, Italian, German, or French. Your AI tutor supports you in your own language while guiding you toward fluent English.\n\n- Real-Time Corrections &amp; Instant Feedback\nGet real-time feedback on grammar, fluency, and pronunciation, so you can practice speaking English anytime, anywhere. \n\n- Motivating &amp; Gamified Learning\nSet daily speaking goals, earn badges, collect points, and build streaks that keep you engaged. BetterSpeak turns language learning into a habit—and a fun one.\n\n- Built for Real People with Real Goals\nFrom passing the IELTS or TOEFL to improving business communication or daily conversation skills, BetterSpeak is your intelligent, always-available tutor for practical speaking success.\n\n- Download BetterSpeak Today\nJoin thousands of learners who are unlocking their English speaking potential with BetterSpeak. Say goodbye to hesitation, and hello to confident, clear communication.\n\n\nWe value your feedback! If you have suggestions or feedback to make BetterSpeak better, we&#39;d love to hear from you. Don&#39;t hesitate to contact us at support@betterspeak.com\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://betterspeak.com/privacy\nTerms of Use: https://betterspeak.com/terms",
