                    googlePlayReviews = "17K",
                    googlePlayRating = 4.6,
                    googlePlayAbout = "Get Paid From Class Action Lawsuits - No Lawyer Needed\n\nEvery year, billions of dollars from class action settlements go unclaimed. PayMe helps you claim your share in seconds. No paperwork. No legal knowledge. Just money you didn’t know you were owed.\n\nKey Features:\n• Find Eligible Class Action Claims Instantly\nAnswer a few quick questions and PayMe matches you with active lawsuits you’re eligible for. No legal advice required.\n• File Claims in Seconds\nSkip the confusing legal forms. We’ll handle the submission process so you can sit back and get paid.\n• Track Your Payouts\nSee exactly when your claims are filed, approved, and when you’ll receive your money.\n• Coming Soon: Cancel Unwanted Subscriptions\nPayMe will soon help you identify and cancel recurring subscriptions you no longer use, saving you even more money each month.\n\nWhy PayMe?\nYou don’t need a law degree or expensive attorney. PayMe makes it simple for everyday people to collect money from companies that broke the rules. Our mission is to help you get what’s yours—fast, safely, and with zero legal hassle.\n\nSubscription Information\nTo unlock full access to claims and payout tracking, purchase a PayMe Pro subscription:\nAuto-renewable subscription:\n• 1 year: $29.99",
