                    appStoreSize = "129.9 MB",
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Finance",
                    appStoreAbout = "Get Paid Money You Didn't Know You Had\n\nEvery year, everyday people miss out on tens of billions of dollars.\n\n• Settlements from companies who violated your rights\n• Accounts you forgot about that got turned over to the state\n• Savings on bills you didn't know you could negotiate\n• Tax refunds, security deposits, gift cards, and so much more\n\nPayMe helps you claim your share in minutes. Rated 4.8 by 34,000+ users, PayMe is the all-in-one app that finds hidden money, lowers your bills, and files claims for you in seconds.\n\nCLASS ACTION SETTLEMENTS\nPayMe's AI scans 5,000+ active class action settlements and matches you with claims you're eligible for - automatically. No legal knowledge required. See a match, tap to claim, and track your payout in real time. Users have already claimed millions through PayMe. Companies overcharged you. It's time to collect.\n\nBILL NEGOTIATION\nYour cable, internet, phone, and insurance bills are almost certainly too high. PayMe connects you with expert negotiators (powered by Billshark) who call your providers and fight for lower rates. Average savings: $300+ per year. You don't lift a finger - we handle everything.\n\nUNCLAIMED PROPERTY SEARCH\nSearch all 50 states for forgotten money that's legally yours. Old bank accounts, uncashed insurance payouts, forgotten tax refunds, utility deposits - billions sit in state treasuries waiting to be claimed. PayMe's dedicated Unclaimed tab makes searching instant.\n\nMASS TORT & PERSONAL INJURY\nBeyond class actions, PayMe checks your eligibility for major mass tort and personal injury lawsuits. These cases can result in significantly larger payouts. Get matched with qualified attorneys - no upfront cost to you.\n\nGMAIL BILL SCANNING\nConnect your Gmail and let PayMe automatically detect overcharges, duplicate fees, rate hikes, and billing errors hiding in your inbox. Most people are overpaying and don't even know it.\n\nGIFT CARD RECOVERY\nGot old gift cards collecting dust? PayMe helps you recover balances from forgotten, expired, or retailer-liquidation gift cards. Money you thought was gone - recovered.\n\nSUBSCRIPTION MANAGEMENT\nSee every active subscription in one place. Spot forgotten free trials before they charge you. Identify services you're paying for but never use. The average American wastes $200+/year on forgotten subscriptions.\n\nTAX CREDIT CHECK\nMillions of Americans qualify for the Earned Income Tax Credit but never claim it. PayMe's quick eligibility check tells you in seconds if you're leaving money on the table at tax time.\n\nWHY PAYME?\n• 8 money-finding tools in one app\n• AI-powered claim matching\n• Expert bill negotiators on your side\n• All 50 states covered for unclaimed property\n• 5,000+ active settlements tracked\n• Real-time claim and payout tracking\n• Rated 4.8 by 34,000+ users\n• No legal expertise needed - ever\n\nPayMe isn't just a class action app. It's the only app that finds every dollar you're owed - from lawsuit settlements and forgotten property to overpriced bills and unused gift cards.\n\nPayMe is free to download with limited features. Premium plans start at $39.99/year. Payment is charged to your Apple ID at confirmation. Subscriptions auto-renew unless canceled 24 hours before the current period ends. Manage in Account Settings.\n\nPayMe uses Apple's Standard EULA:\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
