                    googlePlayAbout = "Yandex AI is designed to empower you and boost your confidence. Learn faster, create with ease, and handle your daily tasks without stress. Now you can experience the internet in a simpler, completely new way: search, browse, shop, book, or chat with AI… all in one app. No switching apps, no clutter, no overthinking.\n\nYou have a single search tool for all your questions, eliminating the need for multiple GPT apps and simplifying your experience. Ask Yandex AI bot and the chat either generates the most relevant up-to-date answer or fetches fresh information from the web with sources. Whether you want to learn something new, plan ahead, or solve a problem, AI chatbot understands your intention and delivers exactly what you need, bringing you a little closer to the person you want to become.\n\nAI Chat &amp; Advanced Search\nThis app is your everyday free problem-solver and all-in-one artificial intelligence companion for work, study, and life. The AI chat helps you turn information into real solutions with clear answers. You get ready-to-act results supported by visuals, tables, graphs, pictures, videos, and links — with no limits.\n\nUnlike other GPT chats, you can ask unlimited questions, analyze images, get summaries, seek deep insights, compare options, and learn anything through structured answers enriched with real information from the web. Additionally, you can create AI generated images to enhance your projects and presentations. The bot works in Turkish and English and is tailored to Türkiye.\n\nInteract through voice, text, or images. Complex topics are explained simply, visuals are analyzed instantly in realtime, and you can make decisions faster. This makes Yandex AI a free chatbot, a math homework helper, an essay writer, a daily problem solver and a highly reliable helper for study, work, or writing tasks.\n\nVideo and Image Generator\nThink about what you want to create and bring your ideas to life with the power of an advanced AI image generator. Create stunning images, graphics, unique art, and personalized visuals all with a powerful picture generator. Make your pictures animated, giving them a video-like effect that creates the illusion of movement. Enjoy unlimited possibilities for creativity with the AI generated content. Seek inspiration and explore deep creative avenues.\n\nBrowsing\nEnjoy seamless internet surfing with a fast browser directly inside the app. Open tabs from the chat, follow links instantly, and search the web without switching to another browser. Everything is built-in, including a web search, so you can quickly find answers to any question.\n\nEveryday AI Assistant\nPlan trips with hotel recommendations, ticket options for traveling, and maps that help you explore restaurants and other interesting places. Stay informed of essentials like news digests, health, wellbeing, technology, finance, reminders, plus daily updates, all with the assistance of your AI bot.\n\nDesigned to go beyond standard GPT chatbots, Yandex AI brings you a fast AI app experience with everything in one place. It supports copy and open actions, delivers fast answers, offers a pro search mode for deeper knowledge, and features image generation for stunning visuals.\n\nWhether you&#39;re seeking deep inspiration, trying to solve complex problems, or exploring new ideas, this mobile AI assistant is here to assist you with no limits. Download the unlimited chatbot, open it, chat with AI, and ask any questions in Turkish or English. Use voice, photo, or text to find what you need. It’s your free AI helper &amp; smart companion for everything: career, relationships, self-improvement, and taking action.",
                    appStoreRating = 4.3,
                    appStoreReviews = 36,
                    appStoreSize = "351.3 MB",
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Productivity",
                    appStoreAbout = "ONE APP FOR EVERYDAY TASKS\nExperience a new, simpler way to use the internet: search, browse, or chat with AI... all in one app. It is built to empower you and boost your confidence. Learn faster, create with ease, and handle your daily tasks without the stress. No switching apps, no clutter, no overthinking.\n\nYou have one single search tool for all your questions: ask Yandex AI, and the chat either generates the most relevant up to date answer or fetches fresh information from the web. Whatever you're trying to learn, plan, or solve, Yandex AI understands your intention and brings you exactly what you need, moving you a little closer to the person you want to become.\n\nAI CHAT & ADVANCED SEARCH\nThe app combines AI chat with advanced search to turn information into real solutions instantly. You can ask questions through text, voice, or images and get summaries, comparisons, analyses, and learning support at any level. \nResponses come enriched with visuals, tables, charts, links, and real-time data from the web. You can get instant image analysis, and reach the most relevant answer faster. Yandex AI is specially adapted for Türkiye.\n\nIMAGE AND VIDEO GENERATOR\nBring your ideas to life with powerful visual tools. Create images, graphics, and personalized visuals for projects, social media, or fun experiments. Animate photos or apply video styles to make your static images feel alive. Everything is generated inside the app and ready for you to use instantly.\n\nBROWSER\nEnjoy seamless browsing directly inside the app. Analyze opened websites with AI tools, open tabs from chat, follow links instantly, and search the web without switching to an external browser. Everything you need for navigation and quick fact-checking is built in.\n\nYOUR EVERYDAY ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE ASSISTANT\nUse Yandex AI every day to make your decisions easier across all parts of your life. Manage your school and learning tasks better with step-by-step solutions and AI-generated courses on any topics.\nStay informed about health, well being, finance and daily essentials like news digests, currency rates, and reminders. \nDiscover what to watch, learn where to go, and explore restaurants or places with suggestions based on real data from the web. \nPlan trips with hotel ideas, flight options, and maps, all inside the app. Whether you are working on your career, managing relationships, improving habits, or simply trying something new, Yandex AI helps you find the right answers quickly and turn them into action.",
