undation in English grammar and vocabulary. Adaptive AI adjusts to your progress so you learn exactly what you need.\n- Improve English accent and fluency with role-plays, open-ended dialogues, and real-life scenarios. Leave language misunderstandings with English conversations behind.\n- Pronunciation Training – Conquer tricky sounds with each daily English practice.\n- Learn with Personalized English Study Sets – Save words, phrases, or sentences from lessons or create your own, explore and share sets\n- Accent Training - Learn English with accent choices: American, British, Australian, and more.\n\nINSTANT FEEDBACK & AI ENGLISH CONVERSATION COACH\n- Indepth Analysis & Progress Tracking – Monitor your improvement with data-driven insights showing your pace, hesitation, and grammar score.\n- Pronunciation & Word Stress Guidance from our AI English Coach – Receive real-time feedback to sound more natural as you speak English.\n\nENGLISH TUTOR BENEFITS\n- Enhanced Global Collaboration: Bridge language gaps with international colleagues or friends.\n- Career Potential: Impress clients and colleagues with polished English communication.\n- Expand Your Network: Practice English, build relationships, and explore global opportunities. \n- Beyond English Pronunciation: Learn grammar, vocabulary, and communication techniques to succeed academically, personally, or professionally.\n---\n\n(*) ELSA PREMIUM\n- Access all advanced features such as exam preparation and targeted courses.\n- Take your English skills to the next level and start for free with a 7-day trial. Yearly and Monthly Memberships are available.\n---\n\nTRUSTED BY ENGLISH LEARNERS AND INDUSTRY EXPERTS:\n- Honorable Mention in the AI and Data category of Fast Company's 2020 World Changing Ideas Awards\n- Top 100 Influencers in State of EdTech Report by EdTech Digest 2020\n- Mentioned by TechCrunch, Forbes, Mashable, VentureBeat, Yahoo, Salma Hayek, and more\n---\n\nConnect With Us\nEmail: support@elsanow.io\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula",
