                    publisher = "Orbit Studios",
                    releaseDate = "2026-03-31",
                    category = "Reference",
                    googlePlayUrl = "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=io.orbitstudios.bible",
                    appStoreUrl = "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/holy-bible-widget-daily-verse/id6760676817",
                    googlePlayRating = 5.0,
                    googlePlayAbout = "DISCOVER THE WORD LIKE NEVER BEFORE\nWhether you are a lifelong believer or just beginning your spiritual journey, this app brings the Holy Bible to life in a way that is profoundly immersive, personal, and deeply meaningful. We designed this experience not just to be read, but to be felt. Transform your daily devotionals, find peace in times of stress, and build a stronger, lasting habit of faith.\n\nTHE BIBLE, YOUR WAY\nStudy the scripture perfectly tailored to your daily routine, whether you are connected or fully offline:\n\n4 Premium Translations: Explore different versions and find the exact tone that speaks to your heart.\n\nImmersive Audio Bible: Listen to the Word on your morning commute, at the gym, or during quiet moments of reflection.\n\nPersonalize Your Study: Highlight your favorite verses, add private journaling notes, and easily bookmark where you left off.\n\nShare the Word: Send beautifully formatted, uplifting passages to friends, family, and loved ones in just a single tap.\n\nWIDGETS THAT INSPIRE EVERY HOUR\nBring the scripture directly to your home screen and lock screen. Our premium widget studio allows you to design your daily faith experience exactly how you want it:\n\nFully Customizable Designs: Choose from dozens of aesthetic backgrounds, elegant fonts, and beautiful color palettes to match your phone&#39;s theme.\n\nMultiple Widget Types: Set up dynamic widgets to display hourly Bible verses, morning prayers, or daily Christian affirmations.\n\nSeamless Integration: Perfect for Home Screen, Lock Screen, and StandBy mode. Let the Word of God greet you every single time you unlock your device.\n\nCINEMATIC BIBLE STORIES\nExperience the greatest stories ever told like never before. From the creation of the world to the epic journey of Joseph: From Pit to Palace, our audio storytelling brings dramatic narratives to life. Featuring premium voice acting, rich soundscapes, and gripping storytelling, every episode is crafted to move your soul.\n\nVERSES &amp; PRAYERS THAT MATCH YOUR MOOD\nLife changes, and so does your need for spiritual guidance. Receive verses, prayers, and reflections refreshed regularly to align with your exact emotional state. Whether you are seeking comfort for anxiety, strength for the day, or gratitude for your blessings, find the perfect Word. Found a verse that heals? Share it instantly to spread encouragement.\n\nDAILY QUIZZES TO GROW YOUR FAITH\nThink you know your scripture? Test your knowledge with daily interactive trivia covering deep Bible facts, Christian history, and the lives of prophets. Challenge your memory, track your daily streaks, and deepen your understanding of the Word in a fun, highly engaging way.\n\nEXPLORE VERSES BY TOPIC\nLooking for specific guidance? Browse thousands of Bible verses meticulously organized by life themes: Love, Anger, Freedom, Hope, Forgiveness, Healing, and Grace. Find exactly the scripture you need, exactly when you need it.\n\nYour faith. Your pace. Your Bible.\n\nSUBSCRIPTION PRICING AND TERMS\n\nHoly Bible Widget offers auto-renewing subscription options to unlock premium features such as full access to cinematic Bible stories, premium widgets, and unlimited audio features.\n\nPayment will be charged to your App Store Account at confirmation of purchase.\n\nSubscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\n\nYour account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.\n\nYou can manage your subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal by going to your Account Settings on the App Store after purchase.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://orbitstudios.io/holy-bible-widget/privacy-policy\n\nTerms of Use: https://orbitstudios.io/holy-bible-widget/terms-of-use\n\nDownload now and start your journey today.",
