                    appStoreSize = "96.1 MB",
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Education",
                    appStoreAbout = "Supernova AI – India's Top Spoken English Learning App\n\nWant to talk English fluently? With Supernova AI, mastering spoken English is now simple, fast, and fun! Whether you want to improve communication, build confidence, or enhance pronunciation, we help you learn to talk English easily in your mother tongue.\n\nJoin over 7 lakh learners who are already learning English with Supernova AI. No boring grammar drills – just real conversations, interactive exercises, and instant feedback to help you speak naturally.\n\nWHY CHOOSE SUPERNOVA AI FOR SPOKEN ENGLISH?\n\n- Learn English in Your Mother Tongue\n\nUnderstanding becomes easier with translations and explanations in your native language. That's why we offer full support in Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, Bengali, and more. Whether you're starting from scratch or brushing up your skills, our app adapts to your level. This method ensures faster and more effective English learning without confusion.\n\n- Fluent Spoken English – Fast and Effective\n\nWith 30-minute daily lessons, 9 out of 10 learners report better spoken English within weeks. Structured exercises, AI-powered corrections, and real-world practice make fluency easy.\n\n- Your 24/7 AI Teacher – Miss Nova\n\nMiss Nova provides instant grammar corrections, pronunciation help, and personalized feedback. Whether you're practicing conversations or working on tricky words, she's always there to guide you.\n\n- Learn to Talk English Naturally\n\nForget memorization – start speaking English from day one! Engaging role-plays, AI-led conversations, and interactive speaking exercises help you develop confidence and clarity.\n\n- Step-by-Step English Learning for All Levels\n\nFrom basic vocabulary to advanced discussions, Supernova AI adapts to your level and provides a personalized learning path to improve your spoken English efficiently.\n\nDownload Supernova AI now and start your journey to fluent spoken English today!\n\nLearn more: https://www.getsupernova.ai/\n\nEULA: http://www.apple.com/legal/itunes/appstore/dev/stdeula\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.getsupernova.ai/privacy-policy",
