                    googlePlayRating = 4.4,
                    googlePlayAbout = "Heart Rate Monitor - HeartIn Blood Pressure Log, HRV &amp; Heartbeat Tracker. Pulse Checker. Heart Rate Monitor - HeartIn Pulse Checker, HRV Trends &amp; Wellness Tracker\n\n❤️ HeartIn – Heart Rate Monitor &amp; Wellness Tracker\n\nHeartIn helps you stay aware of your heart rate patterns and daily wellness habits. Use your phone&#39;s camera to check your pulse, track trends over time, and keep all your wellness data organized in one simple app.\n\n🚀 What You Can Do\n\n✨ Quick Pulse Checks\nPlace your finger on your phone&#39;s camera and flash to get a pulse reading in seconds. A simple way to see your heart rate before or after workouts, during rest, or anytime you&#39;re curious.\n\n📊 HRV Estimates\nView Heart Rate Variability estimates to follow general trends in your rhythm patterns over days and weeks.\n\n🏆 Wellness Score\nEach reading gives you an easy-to-understand score based on your pulse and HRV patterns, helping you notice trends at a glance.\n\n🏃 Activity &amp; Fitness\nTrack your daily steps and stay on top of your movement goals. Explore guided workouts tailored for you, whether you&#39;re looking to stay active, build a routine, or simply move more throughout your day.\n\n🧠 Stress &amp; Mental Wellness\nGet a general view of your stress levels based on your blood pressure readings and follow trends over time. Take self-assessment tests, including Anxiety, Social Anxiety, Depression, Burnout, and Eating Disorder screenings, to better understand how you&#39;re feeling and track your mental wellness over time.\n\n⌚ Wear OS Support\nPair compatible Wear OS smartwatches to sync pulse data alongside your in-app readings.\n\n📝 Personal Logs\nManually record blood pressure and SpO₂ values from your own certified devices. Keep everything in one place for easy reference.\n\n📈 Daily Patterns\nSee how your pulse trends shift throughout your day, during activity, rest, work, or relaxation.\n\n📚 Helpful Content\nExplore articles and tips about healthy habits, fitness routines, and general wellness.\n\n📱 Designed for Simplicity\nHeartIn keeps tracking easy. No complicated setup. No medical jargon. Just clear visuals and simple tools to help you stay aware of your wellness patterns.\n\n⚠️ Please Read\nHeartIn is a wellness and fitness app only. It provides estimates based on camera readings and user-entered data. This app is not a medical device. It does not diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or medical condition. Self-assessment tests are for informational purposes only and do not provide clinical diagnoses. Readings are for personal reference and should not replace advice from a qualified healthcare provider. If you have health concerns, please consult a doctor.\n\nTerms: static.heartrate.info/terms-conditions-en.html\nPrivacy Policy: static.heartrate.info/privacy-en.html\nCommunity Guidelines: static.heartrate.info/terms-conditions-en.html",
