                    appStoreSize = "137.9 MB",
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Utilities",
                    appStoreAbout = "PulseTender is your personal health management assistant, helping you Measure Heart Rate, Log Blood Glucose & Blood Oxygen Levels, Analyze Food GI, Track Stress Levels, and Practice Breathing for more scientific and convenient health management.\n\nMain Features:\n【Measure Heart Rate】\nSimply place your fingertip over your phone’s camera to get real-time heart rate data anytime, anywhere. \n【Log Blood Glucose & Blood Oxygen Levels 】\nLog key metrics like blood oxygen and glucose manually, and view them in clear, colorful charts. Visualize trends through detailed charts and maintain a long-term record of your vital health indicators.\n【Analyze Food GI】\nSimply take a photo of your meal to identify its glycemic index (GI). Get clear insights and help you make smarter, more mindful food decisions.\n【Monitor Stress Levels】\nIdentify high-stress moments, understand how your body responds, and learn to adjust with relaxation guidance.\n【Breathing Exercises】\nEach deep breath fuels your own virtual garden: the weather shifts with your heart rate, and plants grow as you breathe regularly. Turn health habits into a visual and rewarding journey.\n\nDisclaimer：\n-This app is not a substitute for professional medical advice. It is designed only to provide general health information for your reference. If you have any health concerns, please consult a doctor.\n-This app does not support measuring blood glucose or blood oxygen levels, it only provides data recording functionality.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://pulse.pulsetender.com/agreement/PrivacyPolicy-en.html \nUser Agreement：https://pulse.pulsetender.com/agreement/UserServiceAgreement-en.html",
