                    googlePlayAbout = "Singfy Music is a clean, powerful music player that puts your personal music collection front and center. Build unlimited playlists, edit track details, add album artwork, and enjoy smooth playback — even without an internet connection.\n\nKey features\n• Unlimited playlists: Create and manage as many playlists as you want.\n• Advanced music player: Smooth playback, background audio, and lock-screen controls.\n• Local file support: Add and play music stored on your device — no network needed.\n• Album art &amp; metadata editing: Attach album covers and rename tracks to organize your library.\n• Fast search: Find songs instantly by title, artist, or album.\n• Lightweight, multilingual UI: Simple interface designed for quick, everyday listening.\n\nSingfy Music helps you organize and enjoy your music collection — wherever you are.",
