                    googlePlayReviews = "6.18K",
                    googlePlayRating = 4.7,
                    googlePlayAbout = "POV helps you capture the point of view of everyone at your event. It&#39;s perfect for weddings, birthdays, quinceañeras, graduations, bachelorette parties, and more.\n\nLike a digital disposable camera –– cap the number of photos that each of your guests can take and have the photos reveal the next day!\n\nNO DOWNLOAD REQUIRED FOR GUESTS\nGuests can scan a code or tap on a link and don&#39;t have to download this app to participate.\n\nCAMERA\nThe camera is completely customizable –– you determine how many photos each of your guests can take.\n\nGALLERY\nChoose when your photo album reveals — during the event, right after, or on a delay just like a real disposable camera. Create a shared gallery where all guests can relive the best memories together, or keep it private so photos are shared directly with the host.\n\nCUSTOMIZABILITY\nYou can design the screens to look and feel exactly how you want it. Stickers, text, backgrounds + more design tools at your fingertips.\n\nSHAREABILITY\nThe app will generate a QR code and link so that friends can easily find your event. Free Canva QR code templates included to help you get started.\n\nQuestions or ideas? Send us all your feedback. We&#39;re happy to help!",
                    appStoreRating = 4.8,
                    appStoreReviews = 451,
                    appStoreSize = "109.8 MB",
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Photo & Video",
                    appStoreAbout = "How Once Works:\n1. Create a film for your event and set the rules\n2. Share a QR code or link so guests can join in seconds (No download needed for guests)\n3. Everyone shoots in the moment with limited shots per person\n4. Photos unlock together at the time you choose, ready to relive and save\n\nWhy Hosts Choose Once:\n- QR join, no friction: Guests can join with or without the app via App Clip.\n- Shared camera for the whole group: Centralize every candid and POV in one place.\n- Limited shots = better photos: Scarcity encourages thoughtful, story-driven captures.\n- Delayed reveal: Unlock photos at event end or a custom time to keep guests present.\n- Private by default: You control access, visibility, and downloads.\n- Host controls: Set shot limits, reveal mode (instant or delayed), and participant caps.\n- Download everything: Save full galleries to your device or archive them for later.\n- Beautiful “film” feel: Subtle, tasteful looks that keep skin tones and ambience true.\n\nPerfect For:\n- Weddings and receptions\n- Bachelor/Bachelorette parties and showers\n- Birthdays and reunions\n- Group trips and retreats\n- Team offsites\n- School events, clubs, and fundraisers\n\nWe Care About Your Privacy:\nYour event gallery is private by default and controlled by the host. We do not sell your data. See our Privacy Policy at once.film/privacy.\n\nSupport:\nQuestions or feedback? Please feel free to reach out to us at hello@once.film\n\nLife happens only Once. Make sure to capture every angle of it.",
