                    googlePlayAbout = "Capture, Classify, and Globalize Your Knowledge.\n\nRecco is more than just a recorder—it’s your Intelligent AI Assistant designed to transform spoken words into structured, accessible knowledge. Using advanced AI, Recco automatically identifies the context of your recordings to apply specialized transcription and summary logic.\n\nSmart Capture for Every Scenario: Don’t worry about taking perfect notes. Hit record, and let Recco handle the rest. We currently optimize for:\n- Meetings: Distinguish speakers and extract action items and key decisions.\n- Lectures: Focus on core concepts and instructor/student interactions.\n- Consultations: Capture expert advice, symptoms, and solutions clearly.\n- Personal Notes: Organize to-dos, sudden ideas, or journal entries.\n- And more: Specialized logic for Chats, Arguments, and General conversations.\n\nAI-Powered Insights:\n- Smart Summaries: Get the gist in seconds.\n- Global Translation: Instantly translate summaries into dozens of languages.\n- Full Transcription: Searchable, speaker-separated text for every word spoken.\n- AI Chat: Ask questions directly to your notes (e.g., &quot;What were the key takeaways?&quot;).\n\n\nEdit and Organize: Beyond voice, Recco offers a powerful text editor. Type freely, edit AI-generated content, or jot down quick ideas to keep all your thoughts in one place.\nStop recording, start knowing. Experience the future of note-taking with Recco.\n\nTerms of Service: https://rc.recco.pro/web/h5template/7fedc9dc-ae65-4c78-8beb-4a3bc0e331f7-language=en/dist/index.html\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://rc.recco.pro/web/h5template/e69a5609-3efe-447d-9c92-bcc4d7203f53-language=en/dist/index.html\n\nBilling terms: https://rc.recco.pro/web/h5template/b28d0338-98f0-481d-b6ed-240a24de9505-language=en/dist/index.html",
