                    appStoreUrl = "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/juno-chronic-illness-support/id6749455368",
                    googlePlayReviews = "2K",
                    googlePlayRating = 4.7,
                    googlePlayAbout = "IMPORTANT HEALTH INFORMATION\n\nJuno provides general wellbeing support and health-tracking tools. It is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. If you think you may have a medical emergency, contact your local emergency services immediately.\n\nJuno is an AI-powered companion designed to support people living with chronic and invisible illnesses. Whether you have fibromyalgia, MCAS, ME/CFS, POTS, lupus, endometriosis, migraines, IBS, EDS, arthritis, multiple sclerosis, long COVID or other long-term health conditions, Juno is here to listen — without judgement, unsolicited advice or toxic positivity.\n\nEMPATHETIC SUPPORT WHEN YOU NEED IT\n\nTalk to Juno by voice or text, any time of day or night — even during flares, fatigue, or pain — and feel truly heard.\n\nJuno’s conversations are shaped by input from the chronic illness community, so you get responses that understand your lived experience.\n\nTRACK YOUR HEALTH YOUR WAY\n\n• Log symptoms, energy levels, pain and other experiences simply and easily.\n• Spot patterns and triggers over time.\n• Keep a health diary without overwhelm.\n\nThis makes it easier to better understand your body, share insights with your care team, and manage day-to-day life with more clarity.\n\nPERSONALISED &amp; RESPECTFUL\n\nJuno adapts to your specific conditions and preferences, with gentle check-ins that respect your energy levels, pacing, and the realities of chronic illness.\n\nConversations are private and your data stays secure.\n\nWHY JUNO?\n\nLiving with chronic illness can feel isolating, exhausting and unpredictable. Juno gives you a reliable, understanding companion that:\n\n• Listens without judgement\n• Helps you make sense of symptoms and patterns\n• Supports your daily wellbeing in a way that fits your life\n• Creates a trusted space to share what’s on your mind\n\nDownload Juno: Chronic Illness Support and discover a companion that truly understands chronic health challenges — because you deserve support that listens, helps and stays with you.",
