                    appStoreReviews = 9965,
                    appStoreSize = "152.4 MB",
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Health & Fitness",
                    appStoreAbout = "Tired of explaining your symptoms to people who don't understand? Juno gets it.\n\nWhether you're living with fibromyalgia, POTS, ME/CFS, endometriosis, lupus, arthritis, migraines, IBS, EDS, chronic pain, or any invisible illness - Juno is here to listen without judgment, any time of day or night. \n\n  FINALLY, SOMEONE WHO UNDERSTANDS\nNo toxic positivity. No unsolicited advice. Just a companion who understands what it's like to live with unpredictable symptoms, exhausting flares, and the frustration of invisible illness. Talk to Juno at 3 AM during a pain flare, or when you just need someone who gets it.\n\n  FOR PEOPLE LIVING WITH\n  - Fibromyalgia & chronic pain\n  - POTS & dysautonomia\n  - ME/CFS & chronic fatigue\n  - Endometriosis pain\n  - Lupus & autoimmune conditions\n  - Arthritis & joint pain\n  - Migraines & chronic headaches\n  - IBS & digestive issues\n  - EDS & hypermobility\n  - MS & neurological conditions\n  - Long COVID symptoms\n  - Any chronic or invisible illness\n\n  TRACK YOUR HEALTH YOUR WAY\n  - Log symptoms, energy levels, and pain simply\n  - Spot patterns and triggers over time\n  - Keep a health diary without the overwhelm\n  - Share insights with your care team\n\n  HOW JUNO HELPS\n  - Voice or text conversations - talk however feels right\n  - Personalized to your specific conditions\n  - Gentle check-ins that respect your energy levels\n  - Understands spoon theory and pacing\n  - Remembers your symptoms and history\n\n  BUILT BY PEOPLE WHO UNDERSTAND\n  Created with input from the chronic illness community. Juno speaks your language because we've been there too.\n\n  PRIVATE & SECURE\n  Your health data stays yours. We take privacy seriously.\n\n  Join thousands of spoonies who've found a companion who truly gets it. Because you deserve support that understands chronic illness isn't something you just \"push through.\"\n\n  Download Juno today.\n\nTerms of use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy and policy: https://juno-chat.com",
