3 versions of your reading list\n• Improve focus by listening instead of reading\n• Turn written lectures and study materials into audio with an AI reader voice\n• Learn new languages with text to speech and text to voice\n• Enjoy an AI voice experience similar to tools like Speechma, natural reader, and natural reader online, with optional speech to text support.\nWhether you need a voice reader, a free text to speech app, or an advanced text to audio solution, ListenMe is the app you can rely on.\nWith ListenMe, enjoy the most seamless text to speech experience tailored to your daily needs. Whether you’re looking for a reliable text reader to read text from articles, emails, or books, or you simply want a smart way to turn long documents into audio.\n\nThe app supports advanced text to speech AI technology to ensure every word sounds natural and clear. Easily transform your notes, webpages, or PDF files into engaging audio content — perfect for turning any PDF to audiobook in seconds.\n\nListenMe is not just another text to speech app; it’s your go-to text reader for multitasking, learning, or relaxation. Use it to read PDF aloud while commuting, or let it serve as a pdf to audio and text to audio converter for your study sessions.\nWith multiple AI voice text to speech options, customizable reading speeds, and offline support, you’re always in control. From quick reads to full-length documents, ListenMe makes every text to speech, text to voice, and text to audio interaction smooth, smart, and efficient.\nListenMe offers a powerful text to speech engine that makes it easy to listen to your favorite content anytime. Use it as your daily text reader to read text from books, notes, and websites with natural-sounding voices. Instantly convert any PDF to audiobook and enjoy hands-free reading. The app’s smart text to speech AI features ensure smooth playback, even for long documents.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://listenme.co/privacy\nTerms of Service: https://listenme.co