                    googlePlayAbout = "Your pocket interior design studio is here! Instantly find Ashley furniture, home décor, and accessories, get endless style inspiration and use cutting-edge Augmented Reality (AR) to visualize items live in your room before you buy.\n\nMATCH STYLES WITH A PHOTO\nSnap or upload a photo of any furniture or decor item and our Visual Search will instantly uncover matching Ashley designs.\n\nSEE FURNITURE IN YOUR ROOM \nUse our AR feature to realistically visualize Ashley items in your home. See true-to-scale designs in your room through your phone so you know it will fit your decor, style and space perfectly before you buy.\n\nVIEW DETAILS IN 3D \nHigh-quality 3D views of our furniture designs allow you to rotate items 360° and zoom in to see every detail. Easily examine materials, finishes and craftsmanship to ensure it&#39;s the perfect style and fit for your home decor.\n\nNEVER MISS A SALE\nStay informed about every deal! Get alerts for the latest sales and promotions on furniture, decor and more. Simply check the message center for current offers and savings.\n\nFIND AN ASHLEY NEAR YOU \nGet directions to your closest Ashley location, view store hours and call directly from the app. Your local source for home inspiration is just a tap away.\n\nMAKE YOUR DREAM DESIGN AFFORDABLE \nMake your furniture purchase fit your budget with Ashley Advantage™ Financing. Explore easy payment options through our trusted partners and apply effortlessly in the app.\n\nDownload the free Ashley app today and start designing your perfect home!",
