                    appStoreAbout = "Vinlyze is a sleek, powerful all-in-one video player designed for viewers who demand the best playback experience. Whether it's a recording on your phone, a clip in your photo library, or a streaming link from the web, Vinlyze handles it all with cinematic smoothness.\n\n-- KEY FEATURES --\n\n1. Universal Format Support\nPowered by an advanced playback engine, Vinlyze natively supports MP4, MKV, MOV, HLS (m3u8), HTTP streams, and more. Say goodbye to \"unsupported format\" errors.\n\n2. Local Video Library\n- Import videos from Photos or the Files app with one tap\n- Auto-generated crisp thumbnails\n- Organize with custom folders\n- Smart detection of duration and file size\n\n3. Professional Playback Controls\n- Variable playback speed: 0.5x to 2.0x\n- Loop mode and auto-resume\n- Immersive fullscreen mode\n- Gesture-based brightness and volume control\n- Precise seeking and frame capture\n\n4. Personalized Experience\n- One-tap favorites management\n- Automatic playback history\n- Resume from where you left off\n- Storage analytics at a glance\n\n5. Multi-Language Support\nSupports Japanese and Arabic localization based on the device system language.\n\n-- VINLYZE PREMIUM --\n\nSubscribe to unlock:\n- 100% ad-free experience\n- Priority customer support\n\nSubscription Details:\n- Monthly and yearly plans available\n- Auto-renews unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period\n- Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store account settings\n\n-- PRIVACY FIRST --\n\nYour privacy is our priority:\n- All local videos stay on your device — never uploaded\n- Only essential permissions requested\n- See our Privacy Policy for details\n\nTerms of Service: https://www.vinlyze.com/\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.vinlyze.com/\n\n-- CONTACT US --\n\nWe're constantly improving Vinlyze. Reach us via App Store reviews or email if you have suggestions or run into issues.\n\nDownload Vinlyze today and experience video playback the way it should be!",
