                    appStoreChartRank = 96,
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Social Networking",
                    appStoreAbout = "Meet New People, Chat & Go Live on Meetme! \n\nMeetMe is a free social app where you meet new people, make friends, stream live, watch live video streams and chat instantly with others nearby! It’s fun, friendly, and free! Connect for free with nearby locals and singles who want to chat now using text, video chat, and live video streaming features—all inside an active social community built around conversation and making real connections. MeetMe makes it easy to find and meet people nearby for free!\n\nDiscover & Connect with Your Community\nJoin millions of people who use MeetMe to find new friends, meet singles, explore local connections, and hangout with people who share your hobbies, interests, and vibe! Find your tribe and socialize with like minded people like yourself, and start chatting via text, video, or livestreams.\n\nUnlimited Chat & Instant Messaging\nBreak the ice with people nearby or around the world. Unlike some other apps, on MeetMe, messaging is always free and unlimited. Start a conversation with someone near you, connect through video chat, or keep things casual with instant text messages. Whether you’re looking for friendship, genuine connections, casual dating or online chat rooms, MeetMe supports authentic social interactions and makes starting a conversation with strangers simple. \n\nBroadcast Yourself & Go Live\nThere’s always something happening on MeetMe Live! Become a creator, build your following, and climb the leaderboard in our passionate livestreaming community. Express yourself, share your personality, and connect with fans in real time. Send and receive gifts, battle, and even go on dates.  MeetMe empowers creators on Live!\n\nWatch Streamers & Join the Fun\nNot ready to go live yourself? Tune in and watch streamers from around the world on MeetMe Live! Discover entertaining creators, join live conversations, react in real time, send gifts, and connect with communities built around shared interests and good vibes. You can also enjoy hours of entertainment from watching our featured Live shows, and maybe even start your own Live show!\n\nFind Friends, Dates & Everything in between\nMeetMe is designed for all types of social discovery. It doesn’t matter if you’re just looking to chat and make friends, looking for a casual date, or looking for your soulmate – you’ll find them on MeetMe. What are you waiting for?\n\nMeetMe Premium Features\n- Unblur profiles to see who likes you\n- Boost your profile to the top for 2 hours\n- Discover new people in your area before everyone else\n- Undo swipes and rediscover likes you’ve given \n- Get more likes and views due to higher visibility\n- No Ads\n\nTestimonials \n“I’m very grateful for MeetMe because I never would have thought in a million years that it would help me … have friends that I have learned to love, and people from here that I want to attend my wedding because that’s how close we are, and then meeting the love of my life too, it’s so crazy how it’s done all these things for me.” - Gabe\n\n“This has allowed me to stay home, still be social - but then I can blend it with the real world. Now I’ve started meeting all these amazing people I’ve met on MeetMe and they’ve now become some of my great friends” - Blake Premer\n\n“When I downloaded MeetMe and got into livestreaming - I’m able to hold conversations now and I feel more confident as a person” - Charlie (CharmCharlie)\n\n“MeetMe was the first place that I was really able to start to grow. Where on those other platforms people were into my message and my story, silliness and positivity, but MeetMe really granted me the opportunity to get directly to a lot more people and grow that family and that community on a much larger scale than I could before” - Katy B.\n“Every corner of the world I now have friends in those places and it’s because of the MeetMe platform” - Choff\n\n--\nCheck out our Terms of Service:\nhttps://www.meetme.com/terms.php\nCheck out our Privacy Policy:\nhttps://www.meetme.com/privacy.php",
