                    appStoreUrl = "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/split-pay-together/id6753594526",
                    googlePlayReviews = "37",
                    googlePlayRating = 4.1,
                    googlePlayAbout = "Split makes it easy to share expenses, settle payments, and keep track of group spending without the awkward math or reminders.\n\nWhether you’re splitting dinner, planning a trip, sharing rent, or managing group expenses, Split helps everyone stay organized and paid back faster.\n\n• Split bills instantly with friends\n• Scan receipts and automatically divide costs\n• Track who owes what in real time\n• Settle payments quickly and securely\n• Manage shared expenses for trips, events, and everyday life\n\nNo spreadsheets. No confusion. No chasing payments.\n\nBuilt for real life\n\nSplit is designed for everyday situations, dinners, vacations, roommates, events, and group activities. Create groups that stay active over time, add expenses as they happen, and keep everyone on the same page.\n\nWhy people use Split\n\n• One person can pay — everyone settles later\n• Clear balances prevent misunderstandings\n• Easy tracking for recurring or shared expenses\n• Designed for fast, modern payments\n\nSpend time enjoying moments with friends, not calculating who owes what.\n\nDownload Split and pay together.",
                    appStoreRating = 4.7,
                    appStoreReviews = 493,
                    appStoreSize = "82.5 MB",
                    appStoreChartRank = 149,
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Finance",
                    appStoreAbout = "Split Mobile - The Modern Way to Split Anything\n\nTired of chasing friends for payments or figuring out who owes what?\nSplit Mobile is the easiest way to split bills, track shared expenses, and collect payments instantly. Whether you’re splitting rent, dinner, drinks, groceries, concert tickets, or a weekend getaway, Split Mobile turns any group payment into a clear, automated split.\n\nUse fractional splits, itemized totals, or quick even splits. Guests can pay with Google Pay, card, or Apple Pay, even if they don’t have the app. With built-in receipt scanning, transparent totals, and automatic reminders, you’ll never deal with awkward “I’ll get you next time” moments again.\n\nSplit Mobile is the smarter way to manage group payments, shared tabs, and real-life costs fast, accurate, and stress-free.",
