                    oneLiner = "",
                    techStack = "Flutter",
                    originStory = "The origin story defines what motivated the developer to create this app - were they solving their own problem, or did they observe other people struggling with a problem. Did they start it to generate revenue, or did it grow out of a passion project.",
                    growthPlaybook = "The growh story tells what strategy this app leverages to gain users and grow revenue - whether that is a paid advertising strategy, a viral loops strategy where one user pulls in multiple other users, or shared content strategy where users publish their content and drive awareness for the app",
                    iconUrl = "https://assets.mynetdiary.com/images/logo-supported@1x.png",
                    isBookmarked = false,
                    downloads = "10K+",
                    publisher = "AHMED ALGHAMDI",
                    releaseDate = "2025-08-30",
                    category = "Health & Fitness",
                    googlePlayUrl = "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.aghamdii.kalee",
                    appStoreUrl = "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/calorie-counter-mynetdiary/id287529757",
                    googlePlayReviews = "1.38K",
                    googlePlayRating = 5.0,
                    googlePlayAbout = "Transform your health journey with Kalee&#39;s AI-powered calorie counter featuring delightful pixel art design. Our 80-90% accurate food scanner and intuitive interface make building healthy eating habits enjoyable, not overwhelming.\n\nAI CALORIE SCANNING TECHNOLOGY\nOur advanced AI food scanner uses machine learning to instantly recognize thousands of foods and calculate accurate calorie counts. Simply photograph your meal and receive detailed nutrition information including calories and macros. With 80-90% accuracy, our AI provides reliable calorie calculations that help you make informed nutrition decisions without the guesswork.\n\nCOMPREHENSIVE WEIGHT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM\nTrack your weight loss progress with detailed BMI calculations and body composition analysis. Set personalized weight goals and monitor daily, weekly, and monthly trends. Our weight tracker integrates with your calorie data to show how nutrition choices directly impact your weight management journey. Visual progress charts help you stay motivated and identify successful patterns.\n\nDESIGNED FOR HABIT SUCCESS\nUnlike complex nutrition apps that feel like work, Kalee&#39;s charming pixel art interface and streamlined UX make healthy tracking feel natural. Our design philosophy focuses on habit formation - making calorie counting so simple and visually appealing that you&#39;ll actually want to use it daily. The playful pixel aesthetic transforms mundane nutrition tracking into an engaging experience that builds lasting healthy habits.\n\nINTELLIGENT MACRO TRACKING\nMonitor protein, carbohydrates, and fat intake with precision macro tracking designed for serious fitness goals. Whether you&#39;re bodybuilding, losing weight, or maintaining health, our macro tracker adapts to your specific nutritional needs. Set custom macro ratios and receive real-time feedback on your daily nutrition balance.\n\nSMART MEAL PLANNING &amp; FOOD DIARY\nPlan balanced meals with our intelligent meal planner that considers your calorie goals and macro requirements. Keep a comprehensive food diary that tracks eating patterns, meal timing, and nutrition quality. Search through your complete meal history to identify foods that support your health goals.\n\nPROGRESS VISUALIZATION &amp; ANALYTICS\nView detailed analytics showing your calorie consumption trends, weight fluctuations, and macro distribution over time. Our progress tracking system correlates your nutrition data with weight changes to help you understand what dietary approaches work best for your body.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\nAI-powered food scanning with 80-90% accuracy rate\nComprehensive calorie counter using AI\nAdvanced weight tracking and BMI monitoring\nDetailed macro tracking for protein, carbs, and fat\nSimple, beautiful pixel art interface designed for daily use\nComplete food diary with history\nProgress charts showing weight and nutrition trends\nHabit-building design that makes tracking enjoyable\n\nDESIGNED FOR:\nWeight loss and maintenance goals\nMuscle building and bodybuilding nutrition\nAthletes requiring precise macro tracking\nHealth-conscious individuals monitoring nutrition\nPeople who want simple, beautiful app experiences\nAnyone seeking sustainable healthy eating habits\n\nThe Kalee Difference:\nOur unique combination of 80-90% accurate AI technology, beautiful pixel art design, and habit-focused UX creates the only calorie tracker that users genuinely enjoy using long-term. While other apps overwhelm with features, we focus on simplicity and visual appeal that supports sustainable healthy habits. The result is a more intelligent approach to healthy eating that adapts to your individual needs while making the journey enjoyable.",
                    appStoreRating = 4.8,
                    appStoreReviews = 160115,
                    appStoreSize = "329.9 MB",
                    appStoreChartRank = 38,
                    appStoreChartCategory = "Health & Fitness",
                    appStoreAbout = "MyNetDiary is the calorie tracker you'll actually stick with. Log meals in seconds with a free barcode scanner, Meal Scan (just photograph your plate), or quick search. No ads, no account required. Then get on with your day.\n\nTrusted by 32 million people. Named the top weight loss app by Forbes Health (2025). Highest-rated by the American Journal of Preventive Medicine. The New York Times called it simpler, quicker, and better-looking than the competition. Featured in Today's Dietitian, alongside WW and Noom.\n\n\nWHY PEOPLE SWITCH\n\nOur food database has over 2 million staff-verified items with up to 108 nutrients. That matters because most apps rely on crowdsourced data full of duplicates and errors.\n\nWe're also fast. We logged the same 127 foods in every major app over a week. MyNetDiary took 31% fewer taps than the most popular calorie tracker. Less time logging means you actually keep doing it.\n\nThe free version is generous: barcode scanning, macro and 108 nutrient tracking, food diary, calorie calculator, and progress charts. No ads, no paywall tricks.\n\nActive members lose an average of 1.4 lb per week, according to the MyNetDiary Efficacy Report. \n\nMany switched from other diet and nutrition apps.\n\n\nWHAT YOU GET FOR FREE\n\n• Food log with barcode scanner, search, favorites, and recent meals.\n• The largest and most accurate verified food database — 2x larger than competition.\n• Macro and protein tracking with custom daily targets.\n• Nutrition tracking across 108 nutrients — vitamins, minerals, omegas, amino acids — plus water and exercise.\n• Calorie calculator, deficit tracking, customizable dashboard, and progress charts.\n• Coaching tips, meal reminders, shopping lists.\n• Professional Connect: share your diary with a dietitian or coach.\n• Inspiring community with daily success stories.\n• Articles by Registered Dietitians and how-to videos.\n\n\nPREMIUM\n\nUnlock the full power of MyNetDiary with Premium:\n\n• Meal Scan: photograph your plate and log it instantly.\n• Sync with Apple Health, Fitbit, Garmin, and Withings for automatic exercise, steps, and weight.\n• Apple Watch and widgets for quick logging and progress checks on the go.\n• Calorie and macro day cycling.\n• Autologging: set your regular meals once — foods, amounts, days, mealtimes — and MyNetDiary logs them for you.\n• Intermittent fasting with multiple protocols.\n• Diet Autopilot: your calorie budget adjusts automatically as you lose weight.\n• Health tracking: blood pressure, cholesterol, blood glucose, A1C, ketones, medications, and more.\n• Import recipes from the web with full nutrient counts.\n• 600+ recipes and diet plans by Registered Dietitians: High-Protein, Mediterranean, Low-Carb, Keto, and more.\n\n\nGLP-1 COMPANION\n\nA dedicated tracking system inside MyNetDiary, built for people on Ozempic, Wegovy, Mounjaro, Zepbound, and other semaglutide or tirzepatide medications. Turn it on and the app reconfigures around what matters most on GLP-1.\n\n• Medication tracker with reminders so you never miss a dose.\n• Protein-first dashboard that keeps muscle protection front and center.\n• Fiber and hydration tracking — GLP-1 side effects hit harder when you skip them.\n• Symptom logging to spot patterns and share with your doctor.\n• GLP-1 recipes and meal plans built around high protein and easy digestion.\n• Trend charts for weight, protein, hydration, and symptoms in one place.\n\n\nPREMIUM PLUS — AI COACH\n\nAI Coach is built on 20 years of nutrition expertise. Once you try it, you'll wonder how you tracked without it.\n\n• Daily guidance based on what you actually ate, not just what you planned.\n• GLP-1 specific coaching that adjusts advice for medication users.\n• Meal suggestions matched to your calorie budget and preferences.\n• Restaurant menu scan to find the best options when eating out.\n• Voice logging: say your meal and MyNetDiary logs it.\n\nResults may vary. Not medical advice.\n\nPrivacy Policy: www.mynetdiary.com/privacy.html\nTerms of Use: www.mynetdiary.com/terms.html",
